cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository or its experimental framework, please cite this work."
type: software
title: "Unsupervised Detection of Behavioural Regressions in ERP Systems from Field-Level Runtime Traces: A Controlled Evaluation in Odoo"
authors:
  - family-names: "PINNAGODA"
    given-names: "VIDUSHA NASOME"
  - family-names: "Second author"
    given-names: "Second author"
abstract: >-
  A controlled evaluation of unsupervised behavioural-regression detection
  using field-level runtime traces from synthetic procurement workflows in
  Odoo Community Edition 18. The study compares an LSTM autoencoder,
  Isolation Forest, Local Outlier Factor, and a one-class SVM.
keywords:
  - ERP
  - Odoo
  - behavioural regression
  - anomaly detection
  - runtime traces
  - unsupervised learning
license: MIT
